# Scratch: files staged for deletion. This VM cannot unlink, so they are
# moved here rather than removed. Safe to delete the whole folder.
_to_delete/

# Agent tooling, not product code.
#
# The impeccable skill vendors a 16MB tree including a Mach-O binary and two
# scripts that call atob() — all three are things repo-guard is specifically
# written to refuse, so committing this directory makes every subsequent commit
# fail its own pre-commit hook. The skill is installed per-machine; it is not
# something a clone of this repo needs.
.github/skills/
.github/agents/
.github/hooks/
.claude/

# Local impeccable state. design.json is the DESIGN.md sidecar and IS committed.
.impeccable/config.local.json
